<p align="left">Have a nice day !</p></span><span class="normal"><br>        </span></p>      </td>  </tr>  <tr background="barre1.jpg">     <td background="barre1.jpg">&nbsp;</td>    <td background="barre1.jpg"class="auteur">Saradoc</td>  </tr>  <tr><td colspan="2"><br></td></tr>    <td width="560" background="barre.jpg"><span class="GTitre">Reflagging is good for ya !</span><br> </td>    <td width="140" background="barre.jpg" class="date"><div align="right">19/10/2003</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td bgcolor="#2F2828" colspan="2"><p><br>        <span class="normal"><p><strong>KNOCK KNOCK !</strong></p><br />
<p>After the first kills it comes the time for reflagging.<br />
It's with a lot of joy that we meet again our old friends Rallos Zek & Family, Solusek Ro, Trials of Mithaniel Marr... I must say that we have a true relationship with some of them, we try to always keep contact with them, and I think they are happy to see us. <br />
</p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003a.jpg" width="640" height="150"></p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/RallosZek.jpg" width="640" height="512"></p><br />
<p>It is also time for us to seek new friends in the Reef of Coirnav and in Eryslai the Kingdom of Wind. They were very friendly with us and we promised them we would visit again. We learnt that some of them are more susceptible than our previous friends (before starting a discussion about sushis, be aware with who you are talking). </p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003b.jpg" width="640" height="245"></p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003c.jpg" width="640" height="245"></p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003d.jpg" width="640" height="245"></p><br />
<p align="left">We also visited one of the sexiest woman in The World of Norrath : Aten Ha Ra, in fact twice! I think she fell in love with one of our members but I can't tell that it's Gansacco, otherwise she will be mad at me. And I really don't want to hurt her feelings, hobbits are really sensitive to 'hurting feelings' (specialy when this person has 4 arms).</p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003e.jpg" width="638" height="150"></p><br />
<p align="left"><strong>HE IS BACK !!</strong></p><br />
<p align="left">Last but not least! You can stop asking for after 'him', his come back was announced many times, but nobody really knew... <br />
Every single day Bristlebane does, we receive toons of emails, letters, pictures, presents and candies. I can now tell you officialy, that ... he is back !!</p><br />
<p align="center"><img src="news_pics/news_151003f.jpg" width="640" height="440"></p><br />
<p align="left">Have a nice day !</p></span><span class="normal"><br>        </span></p>      </td>  </tr>  <tr background="barre1.jpg">     <td background="barre1.jpg">&nbsp;</td>    <td background="barre1.jpg"class="auteur">Saradoc / Uggie</td>  </tr>  <tr><td colspan="2"><br></td></tr>    <td width="560" background="barre.jpg"><span class="GTitre">Fire tenders</span><br> </td>    <td width="140" background="barre.jpg" class="date"><div align="right">04/10/2003</div></td>  </tr>  <tr>     <td bgcolor="#2F2828" colspan="2"><p><br>        <span class="normal"><b><i>:: SolusekRo ::</i></b><br><br />
<b>MtS</b> have spent most of the last week getting all of its newest members on a level playing field with the rest of the guild over the past week with one aim in mind, the destruction of <i>SolusekRo</i>.<br><br />
<center><img src="http://ion.dc.luth.se/pics/SolusekRo.jpeg"></center><br><br />
It has been the conclusion of months of flagging that has seen the guild progress in leaps and bounds since this Gnome has been putting quill to parchment.  <b>MtS</b> have had few sticking points with some mobs but we have divided and conquered all before us thus fair.<br><br />
